              ┌────────────────────────── Before we start ───────────────────────────┐              
              │telegram-tui can send anonymous crash reports, but this build has no  │              
              │reporting endpoint compiled in, so it sends none.                     │              
              │                                                                      │              
              │Collected: app/OS version, terminal type, a stack trace and error     │              
              │message when something goes wrong, recent action names (e.g. "sent a  │              
              │message"), outcomes, durations, and a random per-install id.          │              
              │                                                                      │              
              │Never collected: message text, contact names, phone numbers, chat     │              
              │titles, file names, your IP address, or your computer's name.         │              
              │                                                                      │              
              │One caveat: an error message is written by whatever failed, not chosen│              
              │from the list above, so it can carry limited content such as a file   │              
              │path.                                                                 │              
              │                                                                      │              
              │Sent to: nowhere. Usage data goes nowhere either, unless you configure│              
              │your own collector.                                                   │              
              │                                                                      │              
              │Change your mind later: `--no-telemetry`,                             │              
              │`TELEGRAM_TUI_TELEMETRY=off`, `DO_NOT_TRACK=1`, or edit config.toml.  │              
              │                                                                      │              
              │             ▶ Enable                             Disable             │              
              │                                                                      │              
              │                                                                      │              
              │↑↓←→/tab choose · ⏎ confirm                                           │              
              │                                                                      │              
              │                                                                      │              
              └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
